(2348646, 326141, 12857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of negative.  You really got the nature of the challenge.  So the blue color on the top of the frame looks like it should be sky but I think it is another dune.  On my screen it is a bit grainy but it does not make a bit of difference.  Great capture. <br/>dc</td>', 'Beautiful use of negative.  You really got the nature of the challenge.  So the blue color on the top of the frame looks like it should be sky but I think it is another dune.  On my screen it is a bit grainy but it does not make a bit of difference.  Great capture. dc', '2006-04-26 23:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348651, 325903, 53147, '<td valign="top">And I thought turkeys looked a bit creepy to begin with. Really glad this is b&amp;w. I dont think it would be as powerful with color. The background blend is cool and the detail on the bird is great. And his eye just adds to the creepiness. Good shot. Bumping up.</td>', 'And I thought turkeys looked a bit creepy to begin with. Really glad this is b&w. I dont think it would be as powerful with color. The background blend is cool and the detail on the bird is great. And his eye just adds to the creepiness. Good shot. Bumping up.', '2006-04-26 23:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348663, 325091, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great lines and colors. Nice to see some vibrant red in the challenge. Very nice that you have no clouds in the sky. The color blending in the sky works really well.</td>', 'Great lines and colors. Nice to see some vibrant red in the challenge. Very nice that you have no clouds in the sky. The color blending in the sky works really well.', '2006-04-26 23:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348667, 326348, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice dark image. Gives me a feeling of being lost. I like that the colors are subdued and the shadow on the rail is a great touch. Well done.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice dark image. Gives me a feeling of being lost. I like that the colors are subdued and the shadow on the rail is a great touch. Well done.', '2006-04-26 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348668, 326101, 12857, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  It really works as a negative.  It is unique in that there are very few candids shots in the challenge and even if there were hundreds they would not be better than this  Not only did you follow challenge rules but you captured the human condition.  BRAVO.   Damn I have to give this a 9.  There goes my chances.</td>', 'I love this photo.  It really works as a negative.  It is unique in that there are very few candids shots in the challenge and even if there were hundreds they would not be better than this  Not only did you follow challenge rules but you captured the human condition.  BRAVO.   Damn I have to give this a 9.  There goes my chances.', '2006-04-26 23:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348673, 326134, 53147, '<td valign="top">Now this is just downright cool. This works great as a negative. Great blending out of the hand and arm with just enough blue. Very impressive. Bumping up.</td>', 'Now this is just downright cool. This works great as a negative. Great blending out of the hand and arm with just enough blue. Very impressive. Bumping up.', '2006-04-26 23:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
