(2351758, 324269, 12857, '<td valign="top">I am not a big woody fan.  In fact this is the first one I have ever commented on.  Something about this is almost flawless.  I would love to see this photo with the joints at the elbow and wrist cloned out. (I know you could not do this for this challenge and I did not hold that against you)   If you did this I think I could see this hanging on my wall.   I also think that I really needed the background exactly as you created it.  The dark blue compliments woody and the lighter background compliment the shawl. However it needed to be 2/3 and 1/3 as this is the balance you created in the subject.  I like the anonymity and form of woodys head. I would love to see this in his extremities.  If you ever get around to it please email me a photo.  <br/>O ya by the way 9<br/>dc</td>', 'I am not a big woody fan.  In fact this is the first one I have ever commented on.  Something about this is almost flawless.  I would love to see this photo with the joints at the elbow and wrist cloned out. (I know you could not do this for this challenge and I did not hold that against you)   If you did this I think I could see this hanging on my wall.   I also think that I really needed the background exactly as you created it.  The dark blue compliments woody and the lighter background compliment the shawl. However it needed to be 2/3 and 1/3 as this is the balance you created in the subject.  I like the anonymity and form of woodys head. I would love to see this in his extremities.  If you ever get around to it please email me a photo.  O ya by the way 9dc', '2006-04-27 21:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
