(2351849, 325091, 12857, '<td valign="top">DARN DARN DARN. I am never going to win a ribbon if people like you keep submitting captures like this.   This is fantastic.   I love architecture and you let me see it in a new way.  The colors are perfection.  I know you did not have a big hand in that other than realizing that you could share this with the rest of us. Also your composition is spot on.  The sphere of the lamp in the foreground almost looks like it was meant to fill the cut out in the rooftop of the structure. 10  Have to add it to my favorites!<br/> <br/>Went back over all my votes.  Only 10 I gave.  Great Great Eye!!<br/>dc</td>', 'DARN DARN DARN. I am never going to win a ribbon if people like you keep submitting captures like this.   This is fantastic.   I love architecture and you let me see it in a new way.  The colors are perfection.  I know you did not have a big hand in that other than realizing that you could share this with the rest of us. Also your composition is spot on.  The sphere of the lamp in the foreground almost looks like it was meant to fill the cut out in the rooftop of the structure. 10  Have to add it to my favorites! Went back over all my votes.  Only 10 I gave.  Great Great Eye!!dc', '2006-04-27 22:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
