(2355148, 326401, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like how the blue pops off the black.  Nicely composed</td>', 'I like how the blue pops off the black.  Nicely composed', '2006-04-29 02:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355149, 326472, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice use of motive.  I like the repeating theme of rectangle.</td>', 'Nice use of motive.  I like the repeating theme of rectangle.', '2006-04-29 02:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355151, 323888, 39484, '<td valign="top">Haunting subject.  The negative makes it even spookier.</td>', 'Haunting subject.  The negative makes it even spookier.', '2006-04-29 02:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355157, 326430, 39484, '<td valign="top">A shot like this takes a certain amount of confidence.  The subject, as per the title, is not readily apparent.  This doesn''t mean it is a bad photo of course, but I''m sure you will get a lot of comments like "out of focus" or "what is this?"  Nevertheless, I like the framing as an abstract.</td>', 'A shot like this takes a certain amount of confidence.  The subject, as per the title, is not readily apparent.  This doesn''t mean it is a bad photo of course, but I''m sure you will get a lot of comments like "out of focus" or "what is this?"  Nevertheless, I like the framing as an abstract.', '2006-04-29 02:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355158, 326224, 39484, '<td valign="top">Love the color palette and the simplicity.  Fantastic.</td>', 'Love the color palette and the simplicity.  Fantastic.', '2006-04-29 02:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355162, 323634, 39484, '<td valign="top">I know this is a negative challenge, but I''m wanting a larger tonal range from highlights to low lights.  I like the classic subject/pose.</td>', 'I know this is a negative challenge, but I''m wanting a larger tonal range from highlights to low lights.  I like the classic subject/pose.', '2006-04-29 02:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355168, 325890, 39484, '<td valign="top">Even though this is a negative challenge, I think that the subject should still be the element of relative highest contrast.  I like how the horse is framed and is looking in the camera.</td>', 'Even though this is a negative challenge, I think that the subject should still be the element of relative highest contrast.  I like how the horse is framed and is looking in the camera.', '2006-04-29 02:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355172, 326461, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and tonal pallet.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and tonal pallet.', '2006-04-29 02:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355175, 326204, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in a challenge that tends to be monochromatic.  It feels a bit crowded in the frame.  Maybe move closer or farther away or off set it in the frame.  Nice choice of subject.</td>', 'Nice colors in a challenge that tends to be monochromatic.  It feels a bit crowded in the frame.  Maybe move closer or farther away or off set it in the frame.  Nice choice of subject.', '2006-04-29 02:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355176, 324897, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice color pallet.</td>', 'Nice color pallet.', '2006-04-29 02:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355177, 326594, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color pallet.  I like how the shapes repeat in the smoke.</td>', 'Great composition and color pallet.  I like how the shapes repeat in the smoke.', '2006-04-29 02:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355182, 324086, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  The horizon does not seem level to me.</td>', 'Great subject.  The horizon does not seem level to me.', '2006-04-29 02:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355185, 326503, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice action.  Subject choice is different than most.  good job.</td>', 'Nice action.  Subject choice is different than most.  good job.', '2006-04-29 02:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355186, 326275, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the cool blue line.  Very industrial.</td>', 'I like the composition and the cool blue line.  Very industrial.', '2006-04-29 02:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355188, 326359, 55985, '<td valign="top">I like the underglow on this one.</td>', 'I like the underglow on this one.', '2006-04-29 02:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355191, 324688, 39484, '<td valign="top">The singularity of the subject is very compelling.  Good concept.</td>', 'The singularity of the subject is very compelling.  Good concept.', '2006-04-29 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355194, 326407, 55985, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, like a pen and ink or line drawing sketch.</td>', 'Nice contrast, like a pen and ink or line drawing sketch.', '2006-04-29 02:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355195, 323676, 39484, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and composition.  I bet you are going to get a bunch of comments about the border.  It doesn''t really bother me.</td>', 'Interesting idea and composition.  I bet you are going to get a bunch of comments about the border.  It doesn''t really bother me.', '2006-04-29 02:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355199, 323731, 39484, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been more striking if the barb was against that great sky.  Good Job.</td>', 'I think this would have been more striking if the barb was against that great sky.  Good Job.', '2006-04-29 02:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355201, 326115, 39484, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Great tight composition.</td>', 'I love this.  Great tight composition.', '2006-04-29 02:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355204, 325509, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is working well as negative. Really looks like night.  Very industrial.</td>', 'This is working well as negative. Really looks like night.  Very industrial.', '2006-04-29 02:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355205, 325492, 39484, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of color.  Reminds me of Kandinsky. 10.</td>', 'Fantastic use of color.  Reminds me of Kandinsky. 10.', '2006-04-29 02:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355207, 326357, 55985, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good job</td>', 'Nice idea, good job', '2006-04-29 02:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355211, 326155, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of subject and the textures involved.  I feel like the shot is presented a bit too obliquely.  My eye tends to build up too much speed and doesn''t rest on the subject.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the choice of subject and the textures involved.  I feel like the shot is presented a bit too obliquely.  My eye tends to build up too much speed and doesn''t rest on the subject.  Good job.', '2006-04-29 02:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355214, 326476, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice take on a this subject.  Formally speaking, odd numbers tend to be more pleasing, but rules are made to be broken.</td>', 'Nice take on a this subject.  Formally speaking, odd numbers tend to be more pleasing, but rules are made to be broken.', '2006-04-29 02:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355219, 325606, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the textures.  I think this has good potential.  The body in the lower right is merging a bit too much with the background for my taste and I would have liked to see the boning completely centered in the frame.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the textures.  I think this has good potential.  The body in the lower right is merging a bit too much with the background for my taste and I would have liked to see the boning completely centered in the frame.  Good job.', '2006-04-29 02:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355224, 324150, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the color pallet.</td>', 'I like the subject and the color pallet.', '2006-04-29 02:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355230, 326044, 39484, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition.  I like how the purples play a strong role.</td>', 'Good subject and composition.  I like how the purples play a strong role.', '2006-04-29 02:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355234, 326407, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great composition and minimalism.  Neat image could have reduced the noise on the bird.</td>', 'Great composition and minimalism.  Neat image could have reduced the noise on the bird.', '2006-04-29 02:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355239, 326100, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  I would commit to the center of the frame or stay on a third.  nice t shirt.</td>', 'Great concept.  I would commit to the center of the frame or stay on a third.  nice t shirt.', '2006-04-29 02:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355242, 325384, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great landscape.  Love the colors and the singular tree.</td>', 'Great landscape.  Love the colors and the singular tree.', '2006-04-29 02:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355248, 326504, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  The bird is so low in the frame and small that it is having a hard time being the subject of the shot.  Looks like a beautiful scene though.</td>', 'Great idea.  The bird is so low in the frame and small that it is having a hard time being the subject of the shot.  Looks like a beautiful scene though.', '2006-04-29 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355251, 324428, 39484, '<td valign="top">You did a great job making these colors pop.  This will do well for sure.</td>', 'You did a great job making these colors pop.  This will do well for sure.', '2006-04-29 02:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355252, 326099, 39484, '<td valign="top">Love the texture and detail.  The eye is drawn the road in a compelling way.</td>', 'Love the texture and detail.  The eye is drawn the road in a compelling way.', '2006-04-29 02:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355254, 326440, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2006-04-29 02:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355256, 324624, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great selection of an unusual subject.</td>', 'Great selection of an unusual subject.', '2006-04-29 02:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355259, 325486, 39484, '<td valign="top">Striking vantage point.  Reminiscent of the Blaire Witch Project.</td>', 'Striking vantage point.  Reminiscent of the Blaire Witch Project.', '2006-04-29 02:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355261, 326386, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice control of the tonal range.</td>', 'Nice control of the tonal range.', '2006-04-29 02:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355271, 326268, 39484, '<td valign="top">Ah! This is scary.  Nice choice of subject.</td>', 'Ah! This is scary.  Nice choice of subject.', '2006-04-29 02:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355278, 325986, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The subject really stands out and has good contrast against the sky.</td>', 'Great composition.  The subject really stands out and has good contrast against the sky.', '2006-04-29 02:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355287, 325916, 39484, '<td valign="top">You are going to probably get a ton of "this is too small" comments.  Great photo though.</td>', 'You are going to probably get a ton of "this is too small" comments.  Great photo though.', '2006-04-29 02:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355293, 324442, 39484, '<td valign="top">i am not sure I ever want to see this again.  Compelling photo.  Good Job.7. :)</td>', 'i am not sure I ever want to see this again.  Compelling photo.  Good Job.7. :)', '2006-04-29 02:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355297, 324332, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice muted palette.</td>', 'Nice muted palette.', '2006-04-29 02:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355305, 325315, 39484, '<td valign="top">Took me a sec to figure out what that was.  The water looks almost ominous, like an uprising of some ghastly ooze emerging from the depths.  Great juxtaposition with the clean lines of the background.</td>', 'Took me a sec to figure out what that was.  The water looks almost ominous, like an uprising of some ghastly ooze emerging from the depths.  Great juxtaposition with the clean lines of the background.', '2006-04-29 02:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
