(2355336, 324429, 39484, '<td valign="top">Funny choice of subject. :)  The pine branches in the background work really well.  As an art piece outside of the challenge, you might want to try just inverting the background and leaving the deer as a positive image.  (using a layer mask or something.)  It might look neat.</td>', 'Funny choice of subject. :)  The pine branches in the background work really well.  As an art piece outside of the challenge, you might want to try just inverting the background and leaving the deer as a positive image.  (using a layer mask or something.)  It might look neat.', '2006-04-29 03:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
