(2361668, 325552, 13879, '<td valign="top">Would be a good shot for ''rhythm'' nice subject for this challenge. Glad you did it black and white.</td>', 'Would be a good shot for ''rhythm'' nice subject for this challenge. Glad you did it black and white.', '2006-04-30 10:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
