(2361679, 326036, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what I am looking at and it hurts the image a bit.  I like the tonal range in the shot but the composition and DOF could be better, I think this would have been better if the object in the middle were composed in one of the corners as with the rule of thirds and were in focus and the backround out of focus... 5 from me.</td>', 'Not really sure what I am looking at and it hurts the image a bit.  I like the tonal range in the shot but the composition and DOF could be better, I think this would have been better if the object in the middle were composed in one of the corners as with the rule of thirds and were in focus and the backround out of focus... 5 from me.', '2006-04-30 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361681, 324859, 13879, '<td valign="top">beatiful! the background is simply stunning, great choice for the challenge!</td>', 'beatiful! the background is simply stunning, great choice for the challenge!', '2006-04-30 10:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361688, 323614, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the composition is pretty bad here.  Hand should not be in the middle like that.  Also has some clutter around it that you could easily have avoided by cropping, like the ticket and object in the lower right corner and that splinter of an item up in the left one.  Sorry to say I gave this a 3, this just doesn´t do a thing for me, put some more thought into your entry next time, I think you can do way better than this.</td>', 'Sorry but the composition is pretty bad here.  Hand should not be in the middle like that.  Also has some clutter around it that you could easily have avoided by cropping, like the ticket and object in the lower right corner and that splinter of an item up in the left one.  Sorry to say I gave this a 3, this just doesn´t do a thing for me, put some more thought into your entry next time, I think you can do way better than this.', '2006-04-30 10:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361693, 325356, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the extreme saturation in this image, makes it seem very muddy.  Like the color composition though, just wish it wasn´t so saturated.</td>', 'Not really fond of the extreme saturation in this image, makes it seem very muddy.  Like the color composition though, just wish it wasn´t so saturated.', '2006-04-30 10:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
