(2364153, 323540, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow, the yellow is really intense in your image! The seeds stand out against the background as they should, the negative seems to emphasize the contrast between subject and background. I also like your framing, the quarter of a circle gives a nice perspective. I''d have preferred a square crop though.</td>', 'Wow, the yellow is really intense in your image! The seeds stand out against the background as they should, the negative seems to emphasize the contrast between subject and background. I also like your framing, the quarter of a circle gives a nice perspective. I''d have preferred a square crop though.', '2006-04-30 19:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364163, 325174, 27845, '<td valign="top">WOW, what on earth is this? A nuclear reactio in a microwave oven. Okay, I''m trying to figure this out. You used zoom blur. The thing inside the oven was bright green - an apple? But I really can''t figure out the shapes around the red. Jeez, this is abstract! Adding to favourites because it maches my head ache.</td>', 'WOW, what on earth is this? A nuclear reactio in a microwave oven. Okay, I''m trying to figure this out. You used zoom blur. The thing inside the oven was bright green - an apple? But I really can''t figure out the shapes around the red. Jeez, this is abstract! Adding to favourites because it maches my head ache.', '2006-04-30 19:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364171, 324539, 27845, '<td valign="top">He, the negative image gives the fish a really spooky look, a bit like a zombie because of the bright eye - or rather the absence of an eye. Maybe a landscape crop would have worked better, I think some more of the image to the left would have been good.</td>', 'He, the negative image gives the fish a really spooky look, a bit like a zombie because of the bright eye - or rather the absence of an eye. Maybe a landscape crop would have worked better, I think some more of the image to the left would have been good.', '2006-04-30 19:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364182, 324688, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool, this looks like a scene from The Ring. I can''t figure out what this looked like as an original, the hand would have had to be glowing?</td>', 'Cool, this looks like a scene from The Ring. I can''t figure out what this looked like as an original, the hand would have had to be glowing?', '2006-04-30 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
