(2364205, 324626, 54843, '<td valign="top">cute.  I would have liked to see the front of the duck or the side, but that is purely subjective.  I think the duck should have been cropped a little to the left (rule of thirds) to help the composition.  Also, if you have moved slightly to the right when taking the picture, the post would not have been running through the duck''s beak.</td>', 'cute.  I would have liked to see the front of the duck or the side, but that is purely subjective.  I think the duck should have been cropped a little to the left (rule of thirds) to help the composition.  Also, if you have moved slightly to the right when taking the picture, the post would not have been running through the duck''s beak.', '2006-04-30 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
