(2375163, 324115, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post Comment--<br/>I am surprised that it didn''t do better.  This is definitely one of the most creative shots of the challenge.  The composition is very nice and the lighting looks great for a negative image.  The brightness of your hair is a bit overbearing, but not enough that I would have voted low.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but this would have been in the 7 range for me.  Nice work and awesome creativity.</td>', '--Trading Post Comment--I am surprised that it didn''t do better.  This is definitely one of the most creative shots of the challenge.  The composition is very nice and the lighting looks great for a negative image.  The brightness of your hair is a bit overbearing, but not enough that I would have voted low.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but this would have been in the 7 range for me.  Nice work and awesome creativity.', '2006-05-03 02:41:45.000000', NULL, 0),
