(2375182, 324965, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post Comment--<br/>Top 15 finish, very well-done.  I think shifting more to your right and cropping off some more of the left would have made it even better.  My favorite element in the shot is the texture that the metal sculptures revealed in negative.  Very well seen and nicely executed.  Congrats on the top 15!</td>', '--Trading Post Comment--Top 15 finish, very well-done.  I think shifting more to your right and cropping off some more of the left would have made it even better.  My favorite element in the shot is the texture that the metal sculptures revealed in negative.  Very well seen and nicely executed.  Congrats on the top 15!', '2006-05-03 02:45:08.000000', NULL, 0),
