(2375259, 326464, 17507, '<td valign="top">I think this image was underscored. Honestly, I think a 5.7+ is more appropriate. The shapes and rhythm are very strong.<br/> <br/>What weakens this most for me, I think, are the 3 blue spots in the black area (the light fixture, I guess). This picture is primarily graphical, and the blue spots distract from the clean geometry. the red tint at the bottom might be unnecessary as well - the color doesn''t add much to the photo. the composition is strong enough that it works well as nearly pure tones.</td>', 'I think this image was underscored. Honestly, I think a 5.7+ is more appropriate. The shapes and rhythm are very strong. What weakens this most for me, I think, are the 3 blue spots in the black area (the light fixture, I guess). This picture is primarily graphical, and the blue spots distract from the clean geometry. the red tint at the bottom might be unnecessary as well - the color doesn''t add much to the photo. the composition is strong enough that it works well as nearly pure tones.', '2006-05-03 03:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
