(2376296, 326248, 42495, '<td valign="top">The colors work well in this photograph, but there is a lot going on.  The purple background works great, but the screen is distracting.  Also, I''m not sure if the main subject is the flower or the stuffed animal.  I think either would have been better on its own.  If the idea was to have the animal hold the flower, then the flower is probably oversized.<br/> <br/></td>', 'The colors work well in this photograph, but there is a lot going on.  The purple background works great, but the screen is distracting.  Also, I''m not sure if the main subject is the flower or the stuffed animal.  I think either would have been better on its own.  If the idea was to have the animal hold the flower, then the flower is probably oversized. ', '2006-05-03 09:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
