(2376388, 326248, 30637, '<td valign="top">Actually this was not a stuffed animal. The shot was taken spur-of-the-moment of a small figurine sitting on the shelf of my screened-in front porch, so the figurine is the cat plus the flower. My decision to submit this was last moment change of challenges. I originally decided to submit to the other challenge - Complimentary colors. I didn''t like my image that much - a rose against the leafy background. I''m still glad that I changed challenges as I don''t think it would have worked. Maybe it worked for me because I knew what I''d done.</td>', 'Actually this was not a stuffed animal. The shot was taken spur-of-the-moment of a small figurine sitting on the shelf of my screened-in front porch, so the figurine is the cat plus the flower. My decision to submit this was last moment change of challenges. I originally decided to submit to the other challenge - Complimentary colors. I didn''t like my image that much - a rose against the leafy background. I''m still glad that I changed challenges as I don''t think it would have worked. Maybe it worked for me because I knew what I''d done.', '2006-05-03 10:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
