(2377049, 325091, 49652, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 5 finish.   It just looks so terrific - the colors, the lines, and the light in front.</td>', 'Congrats on your top 5 finish.   It just looks so terrific - the colors, the lines, and the light in front.', '2006-05-03 12:42:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377066, 324965, 48245, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Congrats!<br/> <br/>p.s. I used to live on that base back in the early 80''s<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-03 11:48:30.</i></td>', 'Very nice! Congrats! p.s. I used to live on that base back in the early 80''s', '2006-05-03 12:48:04.000000', '2006-05-03 12:48:30.000000', 0),
(2377269, 324965, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice placing! And congrats on a second best personal score. :)</td>', 'Nice placing! And congrats on a second best personal score. :)', '2006-05-03 13:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377359, 325009, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. I like that the sharpness seems to just fade as you go out from the center. I''m surprised you didn''t score higher with this. Must have been the "abstract trolls", LOL. Overall, I couldn''t tell you how to improve this, because I like as is.</td>', 'Nice DOF. I like that the sharpness seems to just fade as you go out from the center. I''m surprised you didn''t score higher with this. Must have been the "abstract trolls", LOL. Overall, I couldn''t tell you how to improve this, because I like as is.', '2006-05-03 13:21:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377363, 324451, 53147, '<td valign="top">Spooky and yet still cool. This was (and still is) a very hard challenge to vote and comment on. I gave you a 6 on this but was probably borderline 7. Glad you went with b&amp;w treatment as I dont think color would have helped this. Cool funky shot and I couldnt really tell you how to improve it. Crop is good. Background shading works well and I like how the shirt looks inverted. Good shot.</td>', 'Spooky and yet still cool. This was (and still is) a very hard challenge to vote and comment on. I gave you a 6 on this but was probably borderline 7. Glad you went with b&w treatment as I dont think color would have helped this. Cool funky shot and I couldnt really tell you how to improve it. Crop is good. Background shading works well and I like how the shirt looks inverted. Good shot.', '2006-05-03 13:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377392, 324451, 11854, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great focus, very sharp. Those eyes are incredible. Reminds me almost of a vampire picture. I couldn''t possible tell you how to improve this. (But you might want to send this to Ann Rice for his next book cover!)</td>', 'Wow. Great focus, very sharp. Those eyes are incredible. Reminds me almost of a vampire picture. I couldn''t possible tell you how to improve this. (But you might want to send this to Ann Rice for his next book cover!)', '2006-05-03 13:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377395, 325009, 53147, '<td valign="top">I didnt much care for this one. The DOF leaves me feeling a bit woozy. ( although that may have been your intended effect). Would have liked to have seen more detail inthe droplets maybe. And I think tweaking and bringing out colors would have helped out as well - giving the whole shot another dimension. Looking at the original I am not sure if you could have gotten color out of it. Maybe a tighter crop to get rid of some of the intense blur as well.</td>', 'I didnt much care for this one. The DOF leaves me feeling a bit woozy. ( although that may have been your intended effect). Would have liked to have seen more detail inthe droplets maybe. And I think tweaking and bringing out colors would have helped out as well - giving the whole shot another dimension. Looking at the original I am not sure if you could have gotten color out of it. Maybe a tighter crop to get rid of some of the intense blur as well.', '2006-05-03 13:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377402, 326277, 2490, '<td valign="top">[[Trading Post]]<br/>This strikes me as a very gentle, relaxing image, which usually means it doesn''t have a strong subject or theme.  It is in its own way "abstract", but it''s still recognizable, so it''s not a true abstract.  The out-of-focus stem right in the center steals my eye so quickly; it would have helped a lot to have just physically removed it.  Apparently it was the closest thing to the lens???  A little more black (increasing the contrast) would possibly have made it stronger, but it would have ruined the "relaxing" part.  I like it, though!</td>', '[[Trading Post]]This strikes me as a very gentle, relaxing image, which usually means it doesn''t have a strong subject or theme.  It is in its own way "abstract", but it''s still recognizable, so it''s not a true abstract.  The out-of-focus stem right in the center steals my eye so quickly; it would have helped a lot to have just physically removed it.  Apparently it was the closest thing to the lens???  A little more black (increasing the contrast) would possibly have made it stronger, but it would have ruined the "relaxing" part.  I like it, though!', '2006-05-03 13:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377411, 324965, 2490, '<td valign="top">[[Trading Post]]<br/>Wow.  This is an absolutely gorgeous example of the negative image technique, and I''m surprised you didn''t fare even better than you did.  I can''t offer a doggone bit of advice as to improving; it would have been a definite 10 if I had voted on this challenge.  Congrats on a great score :)</td>', '[[Trading Post]]Wow.  This is an absolutely gorgeous example of the negative image technique, and I''m surprised you didn''t fare even better than you did.  I can''t offer a doggone bit of advice as to improving; it would have been a definite 10 if I had voted on this challenge.  Congrats on a great score :)', '2006-05-03 13:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377413, 326277, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading Post...<br/>I like the softness, but probably most don''t. I always tend to give shots like these higher scores because they''re "feel good" photos. The title suits well. If I had voted in this challenge I would have given this a 7 or 8.</td>', 'Trading Post...I like the softness, but probably most don''t. I always tend to give shots like these higher scores because they''re "feel good" photos. The title suits well. If I had voted in this challenge I would have given this a 7 or 8.', '2006-05-03 13:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377428, 324115, 2490, '<td valign="top">[[Trading Post]]<br/>In general, it looks like it served you pretty well.  The image doesn''t really appeal to me that much, but it is a clever technique, and I probably would have given you a 6 or 7.  While I like blue skies, blue images just don''t appeal to me for some reason, and there''s a lot of blue here.  Excellent idea, and well done.</td>', '[[Trading Post]]In general, it looks like it served you pretty well.  The image doesn''t really appeal to me that much, but it is a clever technique, and I probably would have given you a 6 or 7.  While I like blue skies, blue images just don''t appeal to me for some reason, and there''s a lot of blue here.  Excellent idea, and well done.', '2006-05-03 13:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377431, 324115, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading Post...<br/>Very creative. The really bright white of the hair seems to pop out at me first though. Once I get past that the image is sharp, nice composition.</td>', 'Trading Post...Very creative. The really bright white of the hair seems to pop out at me first though. Once I get past that the image is sharp, nice composition.', '2006-05-03 13:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377432, 326276, 42826, '<td valign="top">nice job placing in the top 50%</td>', 'nice job placing in the top 50%', '2006-05-03 13:33:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377442, 326408, 35804, '<td valign="top">...hehe...I know what it is...   : }<br/> <br/>...perfect title by the way. I didn''t vote in this challenge but I definitely would have given this tops marks for sure.<br/> <br/></td>', '...hehe...I know what it is...   : } ...perfect title by the way. I didn''t vote in this challenge but I definitely would have given this tops marks for sure. ', '2006-05-03 13:34:39.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2377475, 324965, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading Post...<br/>This is a really cool image in negative! The colors are fantastic. Congrats on your second highest finish as well. I couldn''t give you anything to improve this, I like it as is. I didn''t vote on this challenge but probably would have given it a 9 or 10.</td>', 'Trading Post...This is a really cool image in negative! The colors are fantastic. Congrats on your second highest finish as well. I couldn''t give you anything to improve this, I like it as is. I didn''t vote on this challenge but probably would have given it a 9 or 10.', '2006-05-03 13:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377531, 324951, 49007, '<td valign="top">Actually you will notice 4 images that have both positives(+) and negatives(-). There are a +/- Ben Franklin, a +/- Fish-looking-right, a +/- Fish-looking-straight-on, and a +/- bridge with branches (both on left edge).<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone who thought it was good, although i wasn''t the only one to have this idea. I just wish I had pulled it off as well as this one:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=326098" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/485/thumb/326098.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/485/thumb/326098.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/485/thumb/326098.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Actually you will notice 4 images that have both positives(+) and negatives(-). There are a +/- Ben Franklin, a +/- Fish-looking-right, a +/- Fish-looking-straight-on, and a +/- bridge with branches (both on left edge). Thanks to everyone who thought it was good, although i wasn''t the only one to have this idea. I just wish I had pulled it off as well as this one: ', '2006-05-03 13:57:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377543, 325986, 30214, '<td valign="top">Valera,<br/>congrats on another ribbon - now you''ve completed the spectrum :). You got a handle on this thing now - way to go!</td>', 'Valera,congrats on another ribbon - now you''ve completed the spectrum :). You got a handle on this thing now - way to go!', '2006-05-03 14:01:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377564, 326117, 30214, '<td valign="top">Brad,<br/>congrats on another ribbon and a nice shot! Unlike most others it looks so natural it could''ve been a positive :)</td>', 'Brad,congrats on another ribbon and a nice shot! Unlike most others it looks so natural it could''ve been a positive :)', '2006-05-03 14:05:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377568, 324447, 49652, '<td valign="top">Really like this.  The blue, the simplicity, the pelican!  Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Really like this.  The blue, the simplicity, the pelican!  Congrats on your ribbon.', '2006-05-03 14:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377636, 324630, 43156, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 10 and was hoping to see this picture at the top 5, or top 10 at least.<br/>Great use of negative B&amp;W.<br/></td>', 'I gave it a 10 and was hoping to see this picture at the top 5, or top 10 at least.Great use of negative B&W.', '2006-05-03 14:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377741, 326117, 30861, '<td valign="top">WTG Brad. This was one of my top-5 picks!</td>', 'WTG Brad. This was one of my top-5 picks!', '2006-05-03 14:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377745, 324447, 30861, '<td valign="top">Another of my top picks! The purity of the negativity here is breathtaking.</td>', 'Another of my top picks! The purity of the negativity here is breathtaking.', '2006-05-03 14:46:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377748, 325986, 30861, '<td valign="top">Did you have time to say "Hi!" to my daughter? She works at the Star of the Sea right under the bowsprit! Congrats on ribbon!</td>', 'Did you have time to say "Hi!" to my daughter? She works at the Star of the Sea right under the bowsprit! Congrats on ribbon!', '2006-05-03 14:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377753, 323984, 30861, '<td valign="top">Expected a ribbon off this one. Bummer. The colors are just outstanding!</td>', 'Expected a ribbon off this one. Bummer. The colors are just outstanding!', '2006-05-03 14:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377775, 325091, 49716, '<td valign="top">Top quality shot. One of the few in this challenge that looks much better as a negative I think.</td>', 'Top quality shot. One of the few in this challenge that looks much better as a negative I think.', '2006-05-03 14:55:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377787, 323540, 70, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. I think it''s my favorite of the challenge. Interesting colors and very cool detail. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love this shot. I think it''s my favorite of the challenge. Interesting colors and very cool detail. Nicely done.', '2006-05-03 14:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377832, 324308, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, those tombstones look spooky like this! I didn''t vote in the challenge so missed your shot - just coming by now to peek at my favorite photographer''s entry :-)  Congratulations on a well-deserved great placement, Sandy! The lines are beautiful and I can imagine that the non-inverted image is equally as stunning as this one.</td>', 'Ooooh, those tombstones look spooky like this! I didn''t vote in the challenge so missed your shot - just coming by now to peek at my favorite photographer''s entry :-)  Congratulations on a well-deserved great placement, Sandy! The lines are beautiful and I can imagine that the non-inverted image is equally as stunning as this one.', '2006-05-03 15:12:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377882, 323990, 53701, '<td valign="top">Hello Mrs. Cobb<br/> Long time no type :) I also had a pic in this contest you did alot better than i did :( good job. i like this picture, if the trees werent so white it would be a really really really really really really really good picture but its just really good :) have a nice day.</td>', 'Hello Mrs. Cobb Long time no type :) I also had a pic in this contest you did alot better than i did :( good job. i like this picture, if the trees werent so white it would be a really really really really really really really good picture but its just really good :) have a nice day.', '2006-05-03 15:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377897, 324539, 35161, '<td valign="top">A wonderful entry for the challenge! :)</td>', 'A wonderful entry for the challenge! :)', '2006-05-03 15:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377917, 324115, 52336, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have thought to ask for validation, because it seems pretty clear how this was done.  My opinion only of course, but this is more clever than creative, for me.  There''s little to be said compositionally, photographically, etc., apart, perhaps, from the fact that the inverted portions create interesting shapes throughout: the dark area, the bright area (maybe a bit too bright), the bluer area.  I think you met the challenge well.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have thought to ask for validation, because it seems pretty clear how this was done.  My opinion only of course, but this is more clever than creative, for me.  There''s little to be said compositionally, photographically, etc., apart, perhaps, from the fact that the inverted portions create interesting shapes throughout: the dark area, the bright area (maybe a bit too bright), the bluer area.  I think you met the challenge well.', '2006-05-03 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377927, 324965, 52336, '<td valign="top">Really just a beautiful image that truly works well in negative.  Colours are outstanding, and the sculpture, of course, makes for a fantastic composition.  I think the shot was well taken and the subject perfectly placed.  A slight distraction for me is the far background of trees.  Had the left, taller ones not been in view, maybe I wouldn''t notice so much.  Overall, very lovely!  Congratulations.</td>', 'Really just a beautiful image that truly works well in negative.  Colours are outstanding, and the sculpture, of course, makes for a fantastic composition.  I think the shot was well taken and the subject perfectly placed.  A slight distraction for me is the far background of trees.  Had the left, taller ones not been in view, maybe I wouldn''t notice so much.  Overall, very lovely!  Congratulations.', '2006-05-03 15:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377978, 324539, 37961, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 10 on this one but forgot to comment. I really like this negative entry. One of top picks. good work.</td>', 'I gave you a 10 on this one but forgot to comment. I really like this negative entry. One of top picks. good work.', '2006-05-03 15:58:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378005, 326277, 52336, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice image that works well in negative.  It really does have a fragile feel to it.  I may have preferred a tighter crop, to get rid of a large white element at the top.  Focus is kind of soft, but I think that works well with this image.  There is a slight sense of business that may have prevented me from voting higher.</td>', 'I think this is a nice image that works well in negative.  It really does have a fragile feel to it.  I may have preferred a tighter crop, to get rid of a large white element at the top.  Focus is kind of soft, but I think that works well with this image.  There is a slight sense of business that may have prevented me from voting higher.', '2006-05-03 16:02:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378038, 324451, 52336, '<td valign="top">Compositionally very good despite being almost dead-centre, but I think that works well to divide the background into an interesting triangle or arrowhead shape.  Sharpness and detail are good.  Weird hair effect. :)  Negatives are a difficult subject to judge, and my personal taste of not really finding anything appealing about inverted people has likely coloured my opinion.</td>', 'Compositionally very good despite being almost dead-centre, but I think that works well to divide the background into an interesting triangle or arrowhead shape.  Sharpness and detail are good.  Weird hair effect. :)  Negatives are a difficult subject to judge, and my personal taste of not really finding anything appealing about inverted people has likely coloured my opinion.', '2006-05-03 16:09:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378091, 326239, 41337, '<td valign="top">The composition in this was great. Probably suffered because it looked too abstract, which DPC voters tend to not like.</td>', 'The composition in this was great. Probably suffered because it looked too abstract, which DPC voters tend to not like.', '2006-05-03 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378122, 323977, 38496, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  It took me a minute to figure out what it was... looked sort of like a space ship to me.  I like the colors.</td>', 'Interesting picture.  It took me a minute to figure out what it was... looked sort of like a space ship to me.  I like the colors.', '2006-05-03 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378259, 325091, 36988, '<td valign="top">Outstanding finish doc and just a titch below my prediction... no worries... can''t complain about the finish and of course the perfect image added to your collection... :)</td>', 'Outstanding finish doc and just a titch below my prediction... no worries... can''t complain about the finish and of course the perfect image added to your collection... :)', '2006-05-03 17:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378265, 326117, 36988, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on an outstanding capture and a successful finish... well deserved.<br/></td>', 'Congratulations on an outstanding capture and a successful finish... well deserved.', '2006-05-03 17:01:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378274, 326476, 36988, '<td valign="top">Great job Rikki... :)</td>', 'Great job Rikki... :)', '2006-05-03 17:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378295, 323899, 36988, '<td valign="top">I thought was an outstanding entry and very, very original... you got full marks from me for imagination and a unique approach... very well done!</td>', 'I thought was an outstanding entry and very, very original... you got full marks from me for imagination and a unique approach... very well done!', '2006-05-03 17:06:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378296, 326277, 15711, '<td valign="top">So delicate and pretty.</td>', 'So delicate and pretty.', '2006-05-03 17:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378299, 324849, 36988, '<td valign="top">Very underated... nice job on a very unique entry... :)</td>', 'Very underated... nice job on a very unique entry... :)', '2006-05-03 17:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378319, 324266, 30637, '<td valign="top">Actually I like it too, second look. I had given it a 7. I agree with previous post about the negative comment.</td>', 'Actually I like it too, second look. I had given it a 7. I agree with previous post about the negative comment.', '2006-05-03 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378332, 325455, 30637, '<td valign="top">I still like it in spite of the negative comment. I gave you an 8. It''s a very powerful statement! I hope we never forget the atrocities of some of mankind so that they cannot be repeated!</td>', 'I still like it in spite of the negative comment. I gave you an 8. It''s a very powerful statement! I hope we never forget the atrocities of some of mankind so that they cannot be repeated!', '2006-05-03 17:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378338, 324428, 30637, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! A great image. I also gave you a 10.</td>', 'Congratulations! A great image. I also gave you a 10.', '2006-05-03 17:15:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378356, 326098, 30637, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of half a face as one suggested, definitely not "staid" though. I gave you an 8. Congratulations!</td>', 'I like the idea of half a face as one suggested, definitely not "staid" though. I gave you an 8. Congratulations!', '2006-05-03 17:19:20.000000', NULL, 0),
