(2378406, 326057, 45790, '<td valign="top">This one was challenged -- I guess someone thought I was somehow cheating. I was looking for a subject that could be dramatic if I negated the luminance while leaving the colors alone. The waterfall was the perfect choice since the white water turned black yet the foliage, dirt, and sky remained the same.<br/> <br/>Thanks go to individuals who didn''t lower my score because it didn''t look like a traditional negative -- indeed, it isn''t one!<br/></td>', 'This one was challenged -- I guess someone thought I was somehow cheating. I was looking for a subject that could be dramatic if I negated the luminance while leaving the colors alone. The waterfall was the perfect choice since the white water turned black yet the foliage, dirt, and sky remained the same. Thanks go to individuals who didn''t lower my score because it didn''t look like a traditional negative -- indeed, it isn''t one!', '2006-05-03 17:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
