(2386689, 326117, 48066, '<td valign="top">good job! I didnt vote but i predicted that this one would do well. wow, maybe I''m psychic, a part of the "realm of the supernatural" myself...um,  no, just playing.  anyway, very nice picture! mos def one of my favorites.</td>', 'good job! I didnt vote but i predicted that this one would do well. wow, maybe I''m psychic, a part of the "realm of the supernatural" myself...um,  no, just playing.  anyway, very nice picture! mos def one of my favorites.', '2006-05-06 02:27:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2386799, 325986, 47956, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I''d have given it a 10 if I were voting on it. Reminds me of some of the stuff Frank Hurley photographed on Shackelton''s Antarctic trip<br/> <br/><a href="//www.shackleton-endurance.com/images.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.shackleton-endurance.com/images.html</a></td>', 'Great shot, I''d have given it a 10 if I were voting on it. Reminds me of some of the stuff Frank Hurley photographed on Shackelton''s Antarctic trip //www.shackleton-endurance.com/images.html', '2006-05-06 03:29:40.000000', NULL, 0),
