(2762059, 324965, 48228, '<td valign="top">Everytime I see this image in your portfolio, I think to myself, that gee, this is such a strong image, as it has so much impact, and great leading lines. It is a very powerful negitive, as negitives are often softer in appearance. Well done, and I really love this one. I voted high on this one, but had to add another comment, as I have seen it often lately, when commeenting of your other images in your wonderful portfolio.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-26 08:38:42.</i></td>', 'Everytime I see this image in your portfolio, I think to myself, that gee, this is such a strong image, as it has so much impact, and great leading lines. It is a very powerful negitive, as negitives are often softer in appearance. Well done, and I really love this one. I voted high on this one, but had to add another comment, as I have seen it often lately, when commeenting of your other images in your wonderful portfolio.', '2006-08-26 09:37:16.000000', '2006-08-26 09:38:42.000000', 0),
