(4080701, 326430, 78062, '<td valign="top">Ya know, I can''t believe this scored so low! I Love it. It''s about time someone took the time (and courage) to submit something a little bit ''out there'' and not the usual stuff. This is a great image man, you should be proud of it. Its simple, basic, but intriguing because of what seems like a leading line from the bottom left to the top right.<br/> <br/>I would boost the blacks a little bit, but that might take something away from it. It reminds me of a game called Rez on the Dreamcast.<br/> <br/>Be proud man, this is great. If you were famous it would be much hyped.</td>', 'Ya know, I can''t believe this scored so low! I Love it. It''s about time someone took the time (and courage) to submit something a little bit ''out there'' and not the usual stuff. This is a great image man, you should be proud of it. Its simple, basic, but intriguing because of what seems like a leading line from the bottom left to the top right. I would boost the blacks a little bit, but that might take something away from it. It reminds me of a game called Rez on the Dreamcast. Be proud man, this is great. If you were famous it would be much hyped.', '2007-09-11 10:26:43.000000', NULL, 0),
